<h1 class=3D"entry-title">
Fingerpicking Technique </h1>
<p class=3D"mh-meta entry-meta">
<span class=3D"entry-meta-date updated"><i class=3D"fa fa-clock-o"></i><a h=
ref=3D"https://www.guitarlessonworld.com/2015/12/">December 19, 2015</a></s=
pan>
<span class=3D"entry-meta-author vcard"><i class=3D"fa fa-user"></i><a clas=
s=3D"fn" href=3D"https://www.guitarlessonworld.com/author/patmac/">Patrick =
MacFarlane</a></span>
<span class=3D"entry-meta-categories"><i class=3D"fa fa-folder-open-o"></i>=
<a href=3D"https://www.guitarlessonworld.com/lessons/" rel=3D"category tag"=
>Free Lessons</a></span>
</p>
</header>
<div class=3D"entry-content clearfix">
<figure class=3D"entry-thumbnail">
<img src=3D"https://www.guitarlessonworld.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/Fi=
ngerpickingTechnique-678x381.jpg" alt=3D"Fingerpicking Technique" title=3D"=
Fingerpicking Technique">
</figure>
<div class=3D"mh-social-top">
<div class=3D"mh-share-buttons mh-row clearfix">
<a class=3D"mh-col-1-4 mh-facebook" href=3D"https://www.guitarlessonworld.c=
om/lessons/fingerpicking-technique/#" title=3D"Share on Facebook">
<span class=3D"mh-share-button"><i class=3D"fa fa-facebook fa-2x"></i></spa=
n>
</a>
<a class=3D"mh-col-1-4 mh-twitter" href=3D"https://www.guitarlessonworld.co=
