<h2>Travis Picking</h2>
<div align=3D"center"></div>
<p>Named after Merle Travis, this is one of the most famous fingerstyle tec=
hniques.&nbsp; When using the technique, the thumb alternates between bass =
strings (strings 4, 5, or 6) while playing steady quarter notes.&nbsp; Whil=
e this is happening a melody is played using the higher strings (1, 2, and =
3).</p>
