<h3>Applying Travis Picking</h3>
<p>Travis picking is not limited to the pattern I showed you. &nbsp;You sho=
uld be able to recognize it in fingerstyle songs. &nbsp;If you=E2=80=99re w=
riting music, consider using it. &nbsp;Most of all, just have fun with it.<=
/p>
<h2>What=E2=80=99s Next?</h2>
<p>Thanks again for reading one of my lessons to the end! &nbsp;If you like=
d this lesson, there is no greater compliment than to follow me on twitter =
and like me on facebook. &nbsp;You can find links to do that on my <a href=
=3D"https://www.guitarlessonworld.com/contact-patmac/">contact page</a>.</p=
